tions specified by Holoeyes Corporation (hereinafter referred to as \"the Company\") in the manner specified by the Company and provided as a download. For details, please refer to the attached document.\n\nThe latest version of the attached document (electronic attachment) https://holoeyes.jp/pmda/", "short_description": "The medical imaging software \"Holoeyes MD\" is a controlled medical device (generic name: program for general-purpose diagnostic imaging workstations, certification number: 302ADBZX00011000) under the \"Act on Quality, Efficacy and Safety Assurance of Pharmaceuticals, Medical Devices, etc.\" (Pharmaceuticals and Medical Devices Act)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "md_logo.png", "id": "5998065973633964", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003260_5998065976967297_260827317627691552_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kCx3cVXo4MwQ7kNvwGTkNxq&_nc_oc=AdljsmA78gZF4YUSqYbIcV1XI92nF1BOL3p_8V_lLboQT45jL4e5BzIPef4vl_XRtbI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwZaoqYrOV7bHGOG8gHoG6kqssUUiRDltfiOzAhhi5p_A&oe=69B2B0CD"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_tate.png", "id": "2303415159832893", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974904_2303415163166226_7688600240374808365_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PTtKW2u_2vMQ7kNvwEBPul9&_nc_oc=Adkt2IGBJqTVmF7IqTXXEYJHePItuGeTijEbueBCIIhWzJVvQXLE22PmNpn4VmZvOFc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzYY4BXxzuLsST-VBHszrITmt3vNC6xVQ2CXEz5LvD6Mg&oe=69B2A32C"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_miniyoko.png", "id": "950325029433473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031585_950325032766806_6345836855774372629_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f8X25DqxS6oQ7kNvwEgy0Ks&_nc_oc=AdkTk6N0cR_N3-CXJdJDZYwViwSA6tdVcPA85XgXxHoW_zrq6JKKdWPk7QdZ9yrxPKY&_nc_